Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.35,0:00:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnSimHei\fs23\pos(190,135)\fscx130\1c&H000A69&}{\fad(500,600)}狮门影业公开发行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnSimHei\fs23\pos(192,125)\fscx130\1c&H000A69&}{\fad(500,600)}扭曲影业联合奉献
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次时间很长啊\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}That was a long one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是没法告诉我结果\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I don't suppose you can tell me how it looks, can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我只是技术员\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Unfortunately, I'm just the technician.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.37,0:01:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的医生明天会告诉你结果的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Your doctor will have your results tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你需不需要我帮忙  -谢谢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}-Would you like some help to  -Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You're very kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:02:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnSimHei\fs50\bord0\pos(192,82)\fscx130\1c&H00084B&}{\fad(2500,1800)}电 锯 惊 魂 10
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:02:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnSimHei\fs25\bord0\pos(192,230)\fscx130\1c&H00084B&}{\fad(2500,1800)}柔 の 工 作 室 压 制 组
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.82,0:02:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I mean, yeah,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.65,0:02:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,癌症让我生活的每一秒\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}the cancer has brought grief and pain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.99,0:02:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都充满了恐惧和悲伤\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}and fear into my every waking moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克莉斯 最重要的是活在当下\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Okay, Chris. Today is a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“此时此刻”才是最重要的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}That's why they call it the present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有谁想分享吗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Anyone else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利·凯斯勒\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Henry Kessler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.58,0:02:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你请吧\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胰腺癌四期\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Stage four pancreatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,医生跟我说\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Terminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这已经是晚期了 但是\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}That's what they tell me, anyway, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会战斗到底的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'm gonna fight this 'til the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.93,0:02:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有多长时间\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}How much time do I have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一年吗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}A year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最多几个月吧\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Months at best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有很多工作要做呢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I still have a lot of work that needs to be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的建议是\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}My advice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,退休吧\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Retire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你这种情况下\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You know, at this stage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都想找到一个出口\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}everyone always searches for a way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.85,0:03:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但有时候 接受自己命运安排的人\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}But sometimes, those who accept their fate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才过得最轻松\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}have an easier time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.06,0:03:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,轻松 什么轻松\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Easier time? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.09,0:03:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死得轻松吗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Dying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.73,0:03:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你的建议是 让我轻松地去死\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}So, your advice to me is to die easy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命 救救我\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Help! Hey! Help! Help, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你玩个游戏\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'd like to play a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:05:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也许能帮你治好手脚不干净的毛病\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Perhaps one that addresses those sticky fingers of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我注意你很久了 而且我很不满意\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I've had my eyes on you and I do not like what I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,医院保洁是个崇高的工作\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Your job as a custodian is a noble one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扫消杀 帮助减少\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Sanitizing and sterilizing the hospital{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.41,0:05:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,疾病的传播\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}helping patients avoid sickness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你内心的疾病\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}But there is a sickness inside you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.45,0:05:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也需要被清除\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}that needs to be excised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在有个机会 拯救你的灵魂\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You have the ability to not only save{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同时还能保住你的视力\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}your soul today, but your sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只需要把转盘\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}All you have to do is click the dial{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,转动五次\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}across the five positions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你就能活下来 见到明天\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}and you will live to see another day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有一分钟决择\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You have 60 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.37,0:05:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Help, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我 求你了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Help me  Please, please, please. Help. Help{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到啊\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I can't  I can't, I can't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Please, no{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,操你妈\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Fuck you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很明智\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Good choice.{\r}
