Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来好极了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You look marvelous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 我现在感觉也很好\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Thank you. I  I  I feel great.{\r}
