Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说来话长\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}It's a  it's a long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想知道\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'd love to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有时间跟我讲讲吗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You got a minute to tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Sure. Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是这样\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}So, um,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说过这个领域的一个专家\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I read about a doctor, a specialist of sorts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芬·佩德森博士\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}A Dr. Finn Pederson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会进行一种治疗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}He offered a treatment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把药物鸡尾酒疗法与手术相结合\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}and it is a groundbreaking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是突破性的疗法\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}drug cocktail combined with surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我的战斗勋章\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}It's my war wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道看起来很吓人\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I know it looks bad,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但绝对值得\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}but it was totally worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.67,0:09:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-可以在这里接受治疗吗  -不行\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}-Is it available here? -No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在美国没法进行这种治疗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}No, no, the treatment's not available in the States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有获得食品药品管理局的批准\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}The, uh, the medication isn't approved by the FDA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实在任何地方都没有获批\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hell, it isn't approved by anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在挪威接受的治疗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I, um  I haven't seen them since{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.89,0:09:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从那之后就再也没见过他们\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}since my treatment in Norway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}But{\r}
