Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,依然有效\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}is still good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hey, John,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运 哥们\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}good luck, man. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.31,0:10:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为你祈祷\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'm  I'm rooting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保重\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 这种治疗是什么原理\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Doctor, what exactly is the procedure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在特定的环境下 经过适当的刺激\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Well, under the right circumstances and with the proper stimuli,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,基因可以像开关一样 被激活或者关闭\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}genes can be turned on and turned off like a light switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会针对癌症细胞\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}And you're targeting the cancer cells?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功研发出了 最尖端的药物鸡尾酒\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}What we've managed to do is to create a new cutting-edge drug cocktail,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:10:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再配合手术\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}along with surgery,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就能让有害的细胞失活\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}to teach the malignant cells to switch off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太神奇了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,腐败政府与大型制药公司勾结\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}My father, Dr. Finn Pederson, was forced into hiding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的父亲 芬·佩德森博士 被迫躲藏起来\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}by corrupt governments and their relationship to big pharma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.18,0:11:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我的父亲即将成功治愈 数十种疾病\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Because my father was on the cusp of curing dozens of diseases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说 患者不再需要终生服药\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Which means no more need for lifelong medication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.63,0:11:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们能想象这将会有什么影响吗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Can you imagine what that implies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.23,0:11:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大型制药公司对此心知肚明\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Well, the big drug companies certainly can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.03,0:11:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能接受这种打压\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}And I'm here to say that this just cannot stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 在我的父亲继续完善其成果的同时\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}So, while my father continues to make further improvements to his formula,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我将证实他的治疗方法\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'm taking his treatment on the road{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进行更多测试\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}for more trials,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:12:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从而尽可能地拯救生命\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}to save as many lives as humanly possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪位\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塞西莉亚·佩德森\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}This is Cecilia Pederson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是约翰·克莱默吗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Is this John Kramer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Yes, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.39,0:12:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.03,0:12:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们收到了你的邮件和医疗记录\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}We received the email with your medical records, Mr. Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你联系我们\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Thank you for reaching out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正在为我们的项目筛选实验对象\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'm sifting through potential candidates for our program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天给你打电话是因为\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}So, I'm calling you now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们三个月后的治疗有空位\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}because we have spots opening for treatment in about three months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱默先生\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Mr. Kramer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我在\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Uh, yes, I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你等不了三个月了 是吗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You don't have three months, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Okay, listen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.59,0:13:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在正在墨西哥工作\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'm currently working in Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在奥斯陆已经待不下去了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Oslo has become too difficult for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里有一支专家团队\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}But we have a team of specialists here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.46,0:13:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都相信佩德森疗法\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}who share our belief in the Pederson method{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也找到了一批患者\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}and I've gathered a group of eligible patients{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会在下周开始治疗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}to start treatment a week from now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.30,0:13:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你感兴趣的话\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I think I could add one more spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.97,0:13:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以多加一个人\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}If you're interested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.61,0:13:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很感兴趣\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Yes, I'm interested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利·凯斯勒\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Henry Kessler{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是他把你们介绍给我的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}referred me to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.15,0:13:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利啊 看来他情况不错 太好了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Henry. He's doing well. I'm so pleased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I wonder if you could{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多给我介绍一下治疗的信息\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}could you tell me a little more about the treatment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,治疗分为两个部分 一个是我父亲的药物鸡尾酒\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}It's a two-prong treatment that uses my father's Xaxiophenol cocktail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.59,0:13:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及手术切除肿瘤 对你来说就是颅脑手术\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}And in your case, it would be combined with a cranial surgery to clear the tumor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两者结合的效果非常好\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}When both are used together, the results have been stunning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成功率超过九成\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Over 90% success rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.81,0:14:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道路途遥远\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I know it's a long trip,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱默先生 特别是你的情况不适宜旅行\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Mr. Kramer, especially in your condition,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们的诊所环境非常优美\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}but I want you to know that we found a very beautiful location{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在墨西哥城外\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}for our clinic outside Mexico City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它在一个远离网格的郊区\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}It's in a well-off-the-grid area,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常隐蔽 绝对能保证安全和隐私\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}in the countryside where you can have safety and privacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.05,0:14:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你你抵达之后 我们会安排可靠的司机\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}We'll also, of course, arrange for a trusted driver at your arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时间\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}What date did you have in mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五号 下周五\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}The 5th, Friday after next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我能做到\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I think I could make that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-约翰·克莱默  -是我\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}-J. Kramer? Yeah? -Si. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是迪亚哥 欢迎来到墨西哥\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'm Diego. Welcome to Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来吧 这辆车\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Allow me, sir. Please. This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.56,0:14:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看那边\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Take a look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是城都主教座堂\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}That's the Metropolitan Cathedral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是革命纪念碑\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}That's the revolutionary memorial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.94,0:15:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是独立天使\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}That's the Angel of Independence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个 是不是很美\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Take a look at that. Isn't it beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 约翰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hey, J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.61,0:15:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朋友 那是阿兹特克的特拉洛克雕像\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}That, my friend, that's the old Aztec statue of Tlaloc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祭司就在那里\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}That's where the priests{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.35,0:15:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,剜出人的心脏\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}chop the hearts out of their subjects{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后扔到楼下\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}and roll them down the stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每天都有游客让我带他们来这里\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Every day, a tourist wants me to take them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真奇怪\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Very strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.35,0:15:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 约翰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hey, J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.61,0:15:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下车\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Get out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.87,0:16:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.73,0:16:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·克莱默\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再敢撒谎就让你脑袋开花\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Lie to me again and I'll empty this chamber in your eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.81,0:16:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没撒谎 我叫约翰·克莱默\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'm not lying. My name is John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.48,0:16:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心 克莱默先生 没事了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Not to worry, senor Kramer, you're fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.21,0:16:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很安全 跟我来\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You're safe. Come with me. Come, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上车吧 小心头\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Here. Welcome. Watch your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里面\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Es aquí dentro{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的房间\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Your room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.05,0:16:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里 来\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Here. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里了 祝你好运\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}It's here. Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Si?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是约翰·克莱默\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I am John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进来吧\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮您\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}help you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我 加布里埃拉\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I  Gabriela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我家人\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Mi familia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.97,0:17:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,睡觉 这里睡觉\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Sleep. Sleep here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.87,0:18:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塞西莉亚·佩德森博士呢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Dr. Cecilia Pederson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 嗯\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Ah. Si.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她救命 救了我的命\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}She saved life. My life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去 去叫她\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I get. I get now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱默先生 欢迎\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Mr. Kramer, welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路上的欢迎仪式还挺特别的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}That was quite a reception that I got on the way out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.95,0:18:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说我们的迎宾车\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Oh, our welcome wagon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实在抱歉\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I know, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.32,0:18:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是不管去哪我们都必须加强安保\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}But we've had to beef up the security wherever we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大型制药公司一直对我们穷追不舍\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}The big drug companies are always one step behind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们的地址必须保密 连你也不能告诉\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}and so we must keep our location secret from everyone, even you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.77,0:18:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见见我们的团队\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I want you to meet the team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.15,0:19:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是卡洛斯 这里的足球明星\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}That's Carlos. Our local football star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.25,0:19:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他父亲是这里的管理员\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}His father is the caretaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里以前是个化工厂\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}This used to be a chemical factory back in the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马特奥\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Mateo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 博士\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hello, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.89,0:20:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是约翰·克莱默\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}This is John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你 克莱默先生 欢迎来到我们的诊所\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Very nice to meet you, Mr. Kramer, and welcome to our clinic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.69,0:20:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会好好照顾你的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You're in very good hands with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马特奥是阿尔托普拉多医院的麻醉师\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Mateo is an anesthesiologist at Hospital Alto Prado.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在约翰·霍普金斯大学完成了住院医师实习 经常与我父亲共事\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}He did his residency at Johns Hopkins and has worked a lot with my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是的 -他会参与你明天的手术\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}-Yes. -He'll be helping out with your surgery tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.11,0:20:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-有任何需要就来这里找我 -谢谢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}-I'll be right here if you need anything. -Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.38,0:20:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是瓦伦蒂娜 我们的护士之一\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}This is Valentina, one of our nurses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会帮你进行扫描 抽血\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}She'll be taking some scans and drawing some blood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为今天晚些时候的注射治疗做好准备\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}all in preparation for the injection therapy later today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.19,0:21:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希尔斯先生的结果很不错\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Mr. Sears' vitals look good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.52,0:21:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可以出院了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}He's cleared for release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.79,0:21:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帕克·希尔斯 约翰·克莱默\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Parker Sears, John Kramer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甲状腺癌 晚期 你呢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Thyroid cancer, advanced. You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大脑肿瘤\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Uh, brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你赢了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Ah. You win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我昨天做的手术\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Sorry, they cut me open yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.82,0:21:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,切掉了阴茎大小的肿瘤\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Took out a tumor the size of my knob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就要开始鸡尾酒疗法了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'm just about to start the cocktail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,突变的天然杀手细胞\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Mutated natural killer cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我父亲研发的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}They're a type of cytotoxic lymphocyte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,细胞毒性淋巴细胞\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Developed by my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运 约翰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Good luck, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.83,0:21:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经给你定好了酒店\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}So, we've arranged for you to stay at a hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始吧\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Shall we begin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请不要动\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Please, don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱默先生\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}So, Mr. Kramer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.89,0:22:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你是做什么工作的  -约翰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}-What do you do? Like, for a living? -John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫我约翰就好\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Please, call me John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.43,0:22:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是做什么工作的 约翰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}And what do you do, John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当了大半辈子的土木工程师和建筑师\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I've been a civil engineer and an architect most of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.31,0:22:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Now, I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.41,0:22:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就做些业余爱好\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}have a few hobbies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.38,0:22:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜猜\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Let me guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.35,0:22:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,翻新老爷车\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Classic car renovation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.95,0:22:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不是  -不是\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}- No? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.19,0:22:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I, uh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮助人们克服内心的障碍\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I help people overcome inner obstacles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.53,0:22:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助他们在生活中做出积极的改变\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Help them make positive changes in their lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.96,0:22:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,类似心理教练\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Like a life coach, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.00,0:22:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好啊\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Sounds nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助他人就是最有意义的事\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I can't think of anything more important than helping others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.97,0:22:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.61,0:23:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,龙舌兰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Tequila.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能带来好运\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}For good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.72,0:23:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 加布里埃拉\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Thank you, Gabriela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.95,0:23:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}De nada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.09,0:23:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当地人的最爱\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}It's a local favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.22,0:23:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你现在不能喝\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You can't drink it now, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.59,0:23:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,术前不能饮酒\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Not before surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.43,0:23:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“我的太阳西沉 是为了再度升起”\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}"My sun sets to rise again."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.57,0:23:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的太阳一定会再度升起 约翰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Your sun is rising again, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.97,0:23:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会确保这一点\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}We will make sure of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.63,0:24:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会英语吗 卡洛斯\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You speak English, Carlos?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.00,0:24:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Que?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.86,0:24:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来跟我的西班牙语水平差不多\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}That's about as good as my Spanish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.74,0:24:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“拉”怎么说\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}How do you say "pull"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.11,0:24:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉 拉 拉\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Pull, pull. Pull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.41,0:24:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈拉尔\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}halar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.51,0:24:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈拉尔\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}halar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.48,0:24:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 哈拉尔\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Excellent. halar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.49,0:24:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Gracias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.56,0:25:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,手术是谁主刀\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}And who performs the surgery?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.03,0:25:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷蒙·科尔特斯医生\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Dr. Ramone Cortez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.10,0:25:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是阿尔托普拉多的医生\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Also at Alto Prado.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.37,0:25:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是这个国家最优秀的神经外科医生\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}He's the best neurosurgeon in 2,000 miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.34,0:25:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会放心把我的家人交给他\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}He's the doctor I'd use if my own family was on the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.88,0:25:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会进行“清醒开颅手术”\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Now, we'll be performing an "awake craniotomy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.15,0:25:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有部分时间是清醒的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}This means that you'll be floating in and out of consciousness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.05,0:25:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样我们可以进行脑功能测绘\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}so that we can do function mapping{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.45,0:25:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,监控你的脑部活动\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}This allows us to monitor your abilities,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.29,0:25:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了不损伤你的大脑\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}so that we don't touch any part of your brain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.66,0:25:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,控制语言和运动功能的区域\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}that might affect speech or movement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.20,0:26:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱默先生\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Mr. Kramer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.66,0:26:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能动一下手指吗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Can you please wiggle your fingers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.47,0:26:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 运动功能完好\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Good. Motor function is clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.27,0:26:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备抽吸管 谢谢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Suction vac, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.13,0:26:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦伦蒂娜 挪一下\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Valentina, will you move{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.44,0:26:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 好的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Right, right, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.56,0:27:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 现在你可以休息一下了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Okay, great. We're gonna put you back to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.82,0:27:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从10倒数\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'm gonna count down from ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.23,0:27:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,10\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Ten{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.23,0:27:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,9、8\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}nine, eight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.27,0:27:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,7、6\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}seven, six{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.58,0:27:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你醒了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hi, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.48,0:27:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做得很好\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You did great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.75,0:27:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是哪里\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.75,0:27:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在马特奥的医院附近\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}We're two blocks away from Mateo's hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.42,0:27:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以防你需要输血\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}In case you need a transfusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.85,0:27:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的血检结果出来了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I got your bloodwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.13,0:27:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血红蛋白正常了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hemoglobin's normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.87,0:27:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果看起来很好 约翰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}It all looks good, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.20,0:27:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}It all looks good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.57,0:27:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.54,0:27:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每天服用两剂\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Drink two a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.21,0:28:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早晚各一次\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}One in the morning and one at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.28,0:28:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.75,0:28:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面除了我父亲的药剂\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}In addition to my father's treatment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.35,0:28:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有你之后一周需要的止痛药\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}it contains a painkiller you'll need for the next seven days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.08,0:28:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一周之后呢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}And after that, what happens then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.59,0:28:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后就是你的人生了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Your whole life happens then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.33,0:28:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没来得及跟加布里埃拉\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I never got a chance to say goodbye to Gabriela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.67,0:28:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和其他人道别呢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Or, any of the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.87,0:28:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我替你跟他们说\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'll send them your best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.54,0:28:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,头部不要碰水\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Don't get your head wet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.54,0:28:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绷带是抗菌的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}The bandage is anti-bacterial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.97,0:28:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能预防感染\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}It will stave off infection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.51,0:28:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦伦蒂娜会过来帮你检查\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Valentina will swing by to keep an eye on it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.21,0:28:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,休息一下吧 约翰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Get some rest now, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.55,0:28:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.68,0:28:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 佩德森博士\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Dr. Pederson, just so you know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.89,0:28:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明天早上就支付剩余的尾款\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'll wire the second half of the payment tomorrow morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.32,0:28:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 约翰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Thank you, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.89,0:28:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你生活愉快 约翰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Have a good life, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.26,0:28:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长寿 幸福\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}A long, good life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.40,0:30:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有卡片吗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Do you have a gift card?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.20,0:30:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是送朋友的 谢谢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}It's for a friend. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.64,0:30:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请稍等一下\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Un momento, por favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.89,0:31:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.90,0:31:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加布里埃拉\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Gabriela?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.44,0:32:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 欢迎观看\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hello, and welcome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.11,0:32:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,神经外科系列的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}to section five{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.24,0:32:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第五章\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}in our neurosurgery series.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.18,0:32:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人类的大脑非常奇妙 有数亿个\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}The human brain is a mystery, hundreds of millions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.45,0:32:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会进行“清醒开颅手术”\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}We'll be performing an "awake craniotomy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.56,0:32:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有部分时间是清醒的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}This means that you'll be floating in and out of consciousness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.80,0:32:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦伦蒂娜\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Valentina{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.06,0:32:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 好\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Right, right, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.44,0:33:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你生活愉快 约翰\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Have a good life, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.14,0:33:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长寿 幸福\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}A long, good life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.06,0:33:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道吗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hey, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.96,0:33:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿兹特克人把受害者的心脏滚下楼梯后\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Did you know that when the Aztecs roll the heart of their victim down the stairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.36,0:33:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人们会把心脏捡回家 放在房子里\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}people will take them home and display them like ornaments?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.07,0:33:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当装饰品\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}In their fucking houses. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.77,0:34:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到墨西哥\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Nice. Yes, sir, welcome to Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.21,0:34:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Okay, so here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.98,0:34:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是特拉洛克的雕像\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}This is the Tlaloc statue. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.52,0:34:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 玩得开心\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Huh. Thank you, man. Have a good one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.95,0:34:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Of course, man. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.96,0:34:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.16,0:34:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Buenas noches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.83,0:34:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Ayuda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.93,0:35:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Ayuda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.71,0:35:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱默\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Kramer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.77,0:35:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.98,0:35:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道的我全都告诉你了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I've told you what you wanted to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.54,0:35:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要找的人我也全都告诉你了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I fucking told you who you're looking for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.81,0:35:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱默\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Kramer. Kramer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.09,0:36:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 迪亚哥 或者我该叫你\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Hello, Diego. Or, should I call you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.59,0:36:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科尔特斯医生\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Dr. Cortez?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.36,0:36:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你玩个游戏\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I'd like to play a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.96,0:36:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的双臂都连接了爆炸装置\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Attached to your arms are two explosive devices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.30,0:36:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,管状炸弹\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Pipe bombs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.20,0:36:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把炸弹当成是某种肿瘤\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Think of the explosives as a sort of cancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.44,0:36:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是必须切除才能存活的病灶\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}A malignancy that must be cut out for you to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.44,0:36:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,手术刀没法切断镀锌电线\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}The blades cannot cut through the galvanized cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.18,0:36:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是能切开皮肉\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}But they can slice through flesh and muscle,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.65,0:36:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你能切除肿瘤\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}allowing you to cut the cancer away.{\r}
