Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.93,1:46:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了你要的人\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I was able to find the man you asked for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.27,1:46:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Uh-huh. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.11,1:46:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 帕克·希尔斯\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}But Parker Sears?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.21,1:46:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得通过其办法找他\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You'll have to find another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.68,1:46:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上钩了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.65,1:46:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有客人\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}We have a visitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.73,1:46:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塞西莉亚·佩德森\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Cecilia Pederson,{\r}
