Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.71,1:46:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们合作行骗\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}you've each been working a grift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.64,1:46:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个表演\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Playing a role,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.51,1:46:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,互相配合\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}working together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.38,1:47:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续着你们的骗局\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}continuing to play out your scam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.75,1:47:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却没意识到 你们才是今晚的目标\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Never realizing that you have been the marks all night long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.10,1:47:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给了你们获得救赎的机会\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You were given a chance for redemption,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.80,1:47:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但在每个关头 你们都选择死亡\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}but at every turn, you chose death,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.44,1:47:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而没有选择生\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}instead of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.27,1:47:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我向你保证 不管过程如何\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}I promise you, one way or another,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.21,1:47:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一切都会按计划进行\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}it's all gonna work out according to plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.55,1:47:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的最后一场骗局已经结束了\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You have played your last con game{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.35,1:47:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但还有最后一场游戏\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}- No  -  but not your last game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.75,1:47:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们二位曾合作毁灭他人\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}The two of you have worked together to destroy others.{\r}
