Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.50,1:47:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个人能活下来\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}Only one can survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.57,1:47:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,选择权在你们手里\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}And the choice is yours.{\r}
