Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.04,1:49:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-去你的吧 阿曼达 -她会背叛你的\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}- Fuck off, Amanda. - She's gonna burn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.67,1:49:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是还没看出来\N{\fntahoma\fs14\1c&H38B0DE&}You just can't see it yet.{\r}
